atomicassets-api
================

This project is a continuation of `eosio-contract-api`, originally
created by Pink Network (pink.gg):

    https://github.com/pinknetworkx/eosio-contract-api

AtomicAssets is an open NFT standard created by Pink Network, who also
built AtomicHub, the original AtomicAssets marketplace. Ownership of
AtomicHub and this software passed from Pink Network to Spielworks
Markets GmbH, and then to FACINGS INC., the current owner and maintainer.
We thank Pink Network and Spielworks for their work on the AtomicAssets
indexer and HTTP API.

